cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "KRcalculator (krhom): a calculator for exterior-colored Khovanov-Rozansky gl_N link homology"
abstract: >-
  krhom computes uncolored and wedge^a-colored Khovanov-Rozansky gl_N homology of braid closures over Q,
  using localized singular Soergel bimodules and the universal-construction closure. All code was written by
  Claude (Anthropic); the author provided the mathematical direction.
authors:
  - family-names: Yang
    given-names: Hongjian
    affiliation: Stanford University
version: 0.1.1
date-released: 2026-11-16
license:
  - MIT
  - Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/Exista-Yang/KRcalculator"
keywords:
  - Khovanov-Rozansky homology
  - link homology
  - colored link homology
  - singular Soergel bimodules
  - knot theory
